OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F321A1787068093
OL,3,CEgremont Town Hall clock to be
OL,4,Crestored after 10 years out-of-action
OL,6,FA team of volunteers has got
OL,7,FEgremont's historic town clock ticking
OL,8,Fonce more, after a decade of silence.
OL,10,FThe timepiece dates back to 1889, but
OL,11,Fstopped working around ten years ago.
OL,13,FNow, after "two huge donations of
OL,14,F#1000 from local people", a team of
OL,15,Fvolunteers has begun work on the
OL,16,Fclock. They want more people to get
OL,17,Finvolved and say more funds are needed.
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G1/6
