OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F321A1787068093
OL,3,CEgremont Town Hall clock to be
OL,4,Crestored after 10 years out-of-action
OL,6,FEgremont Town Councillor Chris Colley
OL,7,Ftold ITV Border: "Myself and a team of
OL,8,Flocal volunteers have taken it upon
OL,9,Fourselves to get the town clock back
OL,10,Fup and running. It has not worked for
OL,11,Faround 10 years, and we have a project
OL,12,Fto get it as close to possible as it
OL,13,Foriginally was.
OL,15,F"There has been a lot of work
OL,16,Fcompleted up to now and we are in a
OL,17,Fposition to go public for financial
OL,18,Fand physical support."
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G2/6
OL,2,W/.!+.!/*%/.!+,*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
