OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F321A1787068093
OL,3,CEgremont Town Hall clock to be
OL,4,Crestored after 10 years out-of-action
OL,6,FIn February 2026, some of the team
OL,7,Fgained access to the clock tower
OL,8,Finterior, and found it covered in
OL,9,Fpigeon droppings.
OL,11,FLater that month volunteers donned PPE
OL,12,Fand gave it a thorough cleaning,
OL,13,Fbefore returning later to reinforce
OL,14,Fand repair the highest floor of the
OL,15,Ftower.
OL,17,FOnce these first essentials were
OL,18,Fcompleted, team members John
OL,19,FCunningham and Dave Nicholson oiled
OL,20,Fand greased the long-dormant
OL,21,Ftimekeeping mechanism.
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G3/6
OL,2,W/.!+.!/*%/.!+,*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BBorder NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,322,320,120,260,000,100
PN,32104
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F321A1787068093
OL,3,CEgremont Town Hall clock to be
OL,4,Crestored after 10 years out-of-action
OL,6,FThey disconnected the clock faces and
OL,7,Fwound up the clock, and the next day
OL,8,Fthe mechanism was still running
OL,9,Fperfectly.
OL,11,FWhat will the money raised go to?
OL,13,FThe volunteers say donations will
OL,14,Fcover the specialist manufacture,
OL,15,Finstall and maintenance of the:
OL,17,FSince then, volunteers have removed
OL,18,Fthe translucent perspex clock face,
OL,19,Fand have begun to attack corroded
OL,20,Fmetalwork with a wire brush.
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G4/6
OL,2,W/.!+.!/*%/.!+,*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
