FL,322,320,120,260,000,100
PN,32105
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F321A1787068093
OL,3,CEgremont Town Hall clock to be
OL,4,Crestored after 10 years out-of-action
OL,6,FThe volunteers have also managed to
OL,7,Fget the bell chiming again.
OL,9,FThe next step for the clock will
OL,10,Finvolve the Cumbrian specialist firm
OL,11,Fthat helped restore Big Ben in London.
OL,13,FThese experts are set to install an
OL,14,Fautowind system in the tower, keeping
OL,15,Fthe clock running accurately and
OL,16,Fautomatically for years to come.
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G5/6
